# Everything the QQ Music feature needs beyond the app sources lives in one
# place — see qqmusic/README.md:
#   qqmusic/integration/   patch package (modules/ + patches/ + scripts)
#   qqmusic/README.md      what the feature is, how it is built and replayed
#
# Local-only working copies, rebuilt from the recorded base commit:
#   upstream/  pristine upstream source, the reference "unmodified app"
#   testarea/  disposable area where the patch package is replayed and built
